{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Frame Machina - OcularZero</strong>, your <strong>Frame\u2019s ocular vision is damaged</strong>\u00a0your only sight is the minimap. Ambushed and outnumbered, you must rely on instinct, precision, and awareness to survive an onslaught of relentless enemies. This is pure, high-speed arcade survival. No upgrades, no second chances, just you, your Frame, and the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blind Combat, Pure Instinct\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your Frame\u2019s vision systems down, you can only perceive the battlefield through the minimap. Track enemies, react in real time, and fight without ever seeing them directly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Speed, Precision Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive controls let you weave through incoming fire, strafe past threats, and unleash devastation in every direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relentless, Unforgiving Ambush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of enemies will hunt you down with aggression. There\u2019s no escape only survival for as long as you can hold out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hand-holding. No mercy. Just pure skill. <strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456810?t=1745358081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456810?t=1745358081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456810/366345c647327a82a5009737c6ff540b80f82a04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745358081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456810/366345c647327a82a5009737c6ff540b